    "content": "<div class=\"book-content\">\r\n    <p style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\r\n        In Jainism, <strong>Karma</strong> is not just a metaphysical concept but a real substance (matter)\r\n        that gets attached to the soul.\r\n        It is the primary cause of the soul's transmigration in the cycle of birth and death (Samsara).\r\n        Karmas are classified into 8 main types, split into two categories: <strong>Ghatiya</strong>\r\n        (Destructive) and <strong>Aghatiya</strong> (Non-Destructive).\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Ghatiya Karmas -->\r\n    <div class=\"karma-section ghatiya\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"karma-type-title\">\r\n            <span style=\"color: #ef4444;\">🚫</span>\r\n            Ghatiya Karmas (Destructive)\r\n        </h2>\r\n        <p>These karmas directly destroy the natural qualities of the soul (Knowledge, Perception, Bliss,\r\n            Power).</p>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"karma-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"karma-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"karma-name\">1. Jnanavaraniya</div>\r\n                <div class=\"karma-desc\"><strong>Knowledge Obscuring:</strong> Obstructs the soul's infinite\r\n                    knowledge (Kevala Jnana). Like a blindfold covering the eyes.</div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"karma-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"karma-name\">2. Darshanavaraniya</div>\r\n                <div class=\"karma-desc\"><strong>Perception Obscuring:</strong> Obstructs the soul's infinite\r\n                    perception (Darshan). Like a guard preventing audience with the King.</div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"karma-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"karma-name\">3. Mohaniya</div>\r\n                <div class=\"karma-desc\"><strong>Deluding:</strong> The most dangerous karma. It causes\r\n                    delusion about the self and creates passions (anger, pride, etc.). Like intoxication.\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"karma-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"karma-name\">4. Antaraya</div>\r\n                <div class=\"karma-desc\"><strong>Obstructing:</strong> Hinders specific capabilities like\r\n                    charity, gain, and willpower. Like a treasurer refusing to release funds.</div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Aghatiya Karmas -->\r\n    <div class=\"karma-section aghatiya\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"karma-type-title\">\r\n            <span style=\"color: #22c55e;\">🍃</span>\r\n            Aghatiya Karmas (Non-Destructive)\r\n        </h2>\r\n        <p>These karmas do not harm the soul's nature but determine the external conditions of existence\r\n            (Body, Status, Age).</p>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"karma-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"karma-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"karma-name\">5. Vedaniya</div>\r\n                <div class=\"karma-desc\"><strong>Feeling Producing:</strong> Causes feelings of pleasure\r\n                    (Shata) or pain (Ashata). Like licking honey from a sword blade.</div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"karma-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"karma-name\">6. Ayu</div>\r\n                <div class=\"karma-desc\"><strong>Age Determining:</strong> Determines the lifespan in a\r\n                    particular realm (Hell, Heaven, Human, Animal). Like chains binding a prisoner.</div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"karma-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"karma-name\">7. Nama</div>\r\n                <div class=\"karma-desc\"><strong>Physique Determining:</strong> Determines the body type,\r\n                    beauty, strength, and voice. Like a painter drawing a picture.</div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"karma-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"karma-name\">8. Gotra</div>\r\n                <div class=\"karma-desc\"><strong>Status Determining:</strong> Determines high or low social\r\n                    status and environment. Like a potter making high or low quality pots.</div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>"
